  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Council for Soc.Sci Research in Africa, CODESRIA - CODESRIA 2013-</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">R&#xe5;det f samhvetenskapl forskning i Afrika CODESRIA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Council for the Development of Social Science Research in Africa      (CODESRIA) &#xe4;r en pan-afrikansk samh&#xe4;llsvetenskaplig                   forskningsorganisation med m&#xe5;ls&#xe4;ttning att st&#xf6;dja och fr&#xe4;mja          forskning och kunskapsproduktion i Afrika. Dessutom st&#xf6;djer man       publicering och spridning av forskningsresultat. Sida ger &quot;core       support&quot;(basst&#xf6;d)till organisationen.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Council for the Development of Social Sxcience Research in Africa (CODESRIA) is a pan-African social science research organization.     CODESRIA supports research and knowledge production in Africa.        Besides, the organisation is involved in spreading research and       publications on Africa. Sida gives core support to CODESRIA.</narrative>
  </description>
